            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In 1998 Jeff retired from the partnership of PricewaterhouseCoopers"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          281.4736918052256,
          507.87401134453785,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "after over 22 years as a partner in the taxation consulting division. Jeff"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          301.31586579572445,
          680.2216285714286,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "has had extensive experience in the oil, gas and mining industries and has been directly"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          321.1580397862233,
          680.2321542016807,
          11.820842933491804
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "involved, at a senior level, with most major resource projects in Western Australia since the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          341.00021377672215,
          680.2251600840336,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "1970s. He is a past Chairman of the Western Australian Division of the Taxation Institute of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          360.8423877672209,
          69.74101722689076,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Australia."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          400.52792874109264,
          680.232205882353,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Jeff currently serves as a Member of the Salaries and Allowances Tribunal for the State of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          420.3700662114014,
          680.2040743697479,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Western Australia and is a Founding Governor of the Malcolm Sargent Cancer Fund for"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.8240180672269,
          440.21221585510693,
          222.79517142857148,
          11.820830760095077
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Children in Western Australia."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          523.0382660332541,
          507.8722714285715,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Richard Reid is a Fellow of the Institute of Chartered Accountants."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          542.880403503563,
          507.8775256302521,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "After extensive experience in senior auditing positions in London,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          562.7225409738718,
          507.8476714285714,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Belgium and Perth he joined the Clough Group in 1980. Since 1983 he"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          582.5646784441806,
          507.88457142857146,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "has been the Finance Director of the main operating company. He is a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          602.4068159144894,
          507.8723231092438,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Director of Clough Limited, the listed parent company, and a Director"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          370.16107521008405,
          622.2489533847981,
          494.2228201680673,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of a number of the Group’s subsidiaries, joint ventures and associates."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82582689075633,
          661.9344943586699,
          680.2128256302522,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Richard has been intimately involved in all the Clough Group’s major projects and acquisitions"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82582689075633,
          681.7766440023754,
          680.2181487394957,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "over the past twenty years and the successful listing of both parent company Clough Limited on"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82582689075633,
          701.6187814726841,
          680.193531512605,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the Australian Stock Exchange in 1998 and its subsidiary PT Petrosea Tbk on the Jakarta Stock"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82582689075633,
          721.4609311163896,
          680.2181487394957,
          11.820867280285029
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Exchange in 1990. He has significant Australian and overseas experience in Engineering and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82582689075633,
          741.3030929334917,
          578.7062487394958,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Construction; Property and other Investments in both Finance and Management"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          197.82448319327733,
          824.1286074821853,
          680.2251084033614,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
